<Page title="Cookies" description="The cookies this site uses and how to control them." eyebrow="Legal" heading="Cookies." cta={false}>
  <section class="wrap section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="prose"><p>This site sets no cookies until you choose to accept analytics. If you accept, Google Analytics 4 records anonymised page views and enquiry events so we can see which pages help people find us; nothing is used for advertising and nothing is shared beyond Google's processing on our behalf. Decline, and the site works exactly the same with no analytics at all. Our enquiry forms are handled by Netlify and set no tracking cookies. You can change your choice at any time from the link in the footer.</p></div></section>
</Page>
